
---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Organic Intelligence-informed coaching for traders navigating pressure, uncertainty and high-performance decision-making."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#22241f" />
    <title>Trading Mind — Coaching for Traders</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="anonymous" />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;450;500;550;600;650;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />

    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
        --paper: #22241f;
        --ink: #f7f6f0;
        --muted: #d0d0c6;
        --sage: #b4bd94;
        --line: #484a41;
        --button-text: #22241f;
      }

      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
        scroll-padding-top: 32px;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.8;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      a:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--sage);
        outline-offset: 5px;
      }

      .first-screen {
        min-height: 100vh;
        min-height: 100svh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      header {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 30px 7.2%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 32px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .wordmark {
        font-size: 19px;
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: -0.8px;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }

      .wordmark strong {
        font-weight: 650;
      }

      .wordmark span {
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: flex-end;
        gap: 30px;
      }

      nav a {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
        transition: color 180ms ease;
      }

      nav a:hover {
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      nav .nav-contact {
        color: var(--ink);
        border: 1px solid #606157;
        padding: 9px 15px;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }

      nav .nav-contact:hover {
        border-color: var(--sage);
        color: var(--sage);
      }

      .hero {
        width: 100%;
        flex: 1;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 100px 7.2% 112px;
      }

      .hero-content {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 940px;
      }

      h1 {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(46px, 6.1vw, 82px);
        font-weight: 450;
        letter-spacing: -0.065em;
        line-height: 1.08;
      }

      h1 span {
        display: block;
        color: var(--sage);
      }

      .hero-description {
        max-width: 440px;
        margin: 28px 0 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.9;
      }

      .button {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-top: 30px;
        padding: 12px 19px;
        border: 1px solid var(--ink);
        border-radius: 4px;
        background: var(--ink);
        color: var(--button-text);
        font-family: inherit;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 550;
        transition:
          background 180ms ease,
          color 180ms ease,
          border-color 180ms ease;
      }

      .button:hover {
        background: transparent;
        border-color: var(--sage);
        color: var(--sage);
      }

      .approach {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding: 76px 7.2% 84px;
      }

      .approach-grid {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 1120px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .approach-card {
        min-width: 0;
        padding: 25px 23px 27px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 5px;
        background: transparent;
      }

      .approach-card h2 {
        margin: 0 0 13px;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 550;
        letter-spacing: -0.025em;
        line-height: 1.4;
      }

      .approach-card p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.9;
      }

      .contact {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding: 76px 7.2% 82px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .contact h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(29px, 3.2vw, 39px);
        font-weight: 450;
        letter-spacing: -0.045em;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }

      .contact p {
        max-width: 390px;
        margin: 15px auto 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 15px;
      }

      .contact .button {
        margin-top: 25px;
      }

      footer {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding: 25px 7.2%;
      }

      footer .wordmark {
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      footer p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      @media (min-width: 1400px) {
        .hero {
          padding-top: 130px;
          padding-bottom: 140px;
        }

        .approach {
          padding-top: 92px;
          padding-bottom: 96px;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        header {
          padding: 24px 6%;
          align-items: flex-start;
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 23px;
        }

        nav {
          width: 100%;
          justify-content: flex-start;
          flex-wrap: wrap;
          gap: 13px 23px;
        }

        nav .nav-contact {
          padding: 6px 10px;
        }

        .hero {
          padding: 86px 6% 94px;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: clamp(43px, 10vw, 66px);
          letter-spacing: -0.06em;
        }

        .hero-description {
          max-width: 380px;
          margin-top: 23px;
          font-size: 15px;
        }

        .approach {
          padding: 48px 6% 56px;
        }

        .approach-grid {
          max-width: 520px;
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 14px;
        }

        .approach-card {
          padding: 24px 22px;
        }

        .approach-card p {
          font-size: 15px;
        }

        .contact {
          padding: 65px 6% 70px;
        }

        footer {
          padding: 22px 6%;
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        html {
          scroll-behavior: auto;
        }

        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
          transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="first-screen">
      <header>
        <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Trading Mind home">
          <strong>trading</strong><span>mind</span>
        </a>

        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="#approach">Approach</a>
          <a href="/course">Course</a>
          <a class="nav-contact" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <main class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <h1>
            Develop your
            <span>nervous system capacity</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="hero-description">
            One-to-one coaching for traders who want to improve performance
            and develop a more enjoyable relationship with trading
          </p>

          <a class="button" href="#contact">Explore coaching</a>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>

    <section class="approach" id="approach">
      <div class="approach-grid">
        <article class="approach-card">
          <h2>The challenge</h2>
          <p>
            It doesn't matter how good your strategy is if you can't execute it. If you find yourself becoming overwhelmed by the stress of trading, nervous system capacity is the constraint.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="approach-card">
          <h2>A different approach</h2>
          <p>
            Instead of controlling emotions or correcting unwanted behaviour through willpower or discipline, I work with the underlying nervous system patterns impacting your ability to perform well under pressure.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="approach-card">
          <h2>How it works</h2>
          <p>
            One-to-one sessions support your ability to navigate the demands of trading with less internal struggle. Increase bandwidth for performance and develop a more enjoyable relationship with trading.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="contact" id="contact">
      <h2>Interested in working together?</h2>


      <a
        class="button"
        href="https://x.com/youngtilopa"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Get in touch
      </a>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Trading Mind home">
        <strong>trading</strong><span>mind</span>
      </a>
      <p>© {year} Trading Mind</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
